  articleID: https://OskarsUpdates/Today
  title: Oskar's Last Day
  headliner: <b>STARS EXIT NEW MANILA AS "THE SLAP" DOMINATES POST-OSKARS GOSSIP</b>
  bodyText: "With the curtains officially drawn on the Oskars and A-list attendees
    departing New Manila International Airport on private jets this morning, the
    city's entertainment district is slowly returning to normal, except for the deafening
    online chatter surrounding Bill Smith's jaw-dropping onstage slap of host Chris
    Brock. \r\n\r\nMore about this story :\r\n"
  externalLinkBodyText: 'Although Smith went on to claim the Best Actor trophy later
    that evening before quietly slipping out of the New Manila Theatre, social media
    feeds across the city remain flooded with slow-motion replays, memes, and heated
    debates over whether the Academy should strip his award. '
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - "The goodbye ceremony was better last year smh\u2026"
  - I used to watch that guy on TV, good times.
  - WAIT I HAVEN'T GOTTEN MY SELFIE YET !
  - Goodbye and good riddance.
